class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/b821aebdf5c29e70823d11e13c51f5c3.webp?t=1758864011\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.poster.avif?t=1758864011\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.webm?t=1758864011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/16c84412b9585087052c1fb6a6c3dcc2.mp4?t=1758864011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Towerbolt, speed is more important than being careful or precise.\u00a0 The only thing that will kill you is the big laser chasing you, and every alarm hazard tile you touch will speed up the laser instead of killing you.\u00a0 Making imprecise jumps and making mistakes is okay, as long as you're fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/64f82cd30f033b25098da10897136753.webp?t=1758864011\" width=459 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559220/extras/73a1164dc63b32640c45c121a08039d4.poster.avif?t=1758864011\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic